Recognize completed verbose Go benchmarks in JUnit XML. Benchmark result rows
replace absent pass events, including their parents, without hiding explicit
failures or unfinished siblings. The pinned v0.63.0 and latest v0.64.2 converters
still report completed benchmarks as "No pass/skip/fail event found for test".
This local candidate can be removed once rules_go releases an equivalent fix.
Source: https://github.com/bazel-contrib/rules_go/blob/v0.64.2/go/tools/bzltestutil/xml.go

